      "message": "It looks like we\u0027re already sending a `EC_MKBP_FP_FINGER_DOWN` event here. Is this case mutually exclusive from the one below? If so, can you add a comment explaining the difference?\n\nAlso, do we have test coverage that verifies we get the `EC_MKBP_FP_FINGER_DOWN` event for this case? That would also help make this change clearer and distinguish between the two cases. (Separate CL if we don\u0027t have existing test coverage.)",
